*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.xz
*.tar.lzma
*.tar.lz
*.tar.zst
# Error output (narrow to common names/paths if you need to track some error.*)
error.log
error.txt

# Data / list files (Kaldi-style)
*.scp
*.json
*.list
# experiment_report 全局持久 flock（mode 锁位于已忽略的 data/ 下）
docs/reports/experiments/.experiment_report.lock

# 例外：Hive/AudioSet ontology 作为统一管道配置的一部分纳入版本控制
!tools/noise_filter_pipeline/config/ontology/*.json

