research/
autoresearch/

# AI Research Skills / autoresearch workspace — do not commit to git
.research/research-state.yaml
.research/research-log.md
.research/findings.md
.research/literature/
.research/to_human/
.research/paper/
.research/experiments/

# HTML：默认忽略；允许提交 docs 下的用户指南内嵌页面
*.html
!docs/**/*.html

# Markdown：允许提交根 README、docs 下全部文档以及 configs 子目录 README，其余任意 .md 均忽略
*.md
!/README.md
!docs/**/*.md
!/AGENTS.md
!configs/**/README.md
!tools/prepare_data_tools/generators/se/README.md
!tools/prepare_data_tools/generators/ssl/README.md
# 例外：仅纳入 core/losses 的 Loss 说明，不放开其他 core Markdown
!/core/losses/README.md
# 例外：任务模块 README 纳入版本控制（任务规则唯一落点）；TSE 权重存放约定单独放开
!tasks/*/README.md
!tasks/tse/speaker_embedding_models/README.md
!tasks/tse/pretrained_models/README.md
# 例外：tools/verify 与 tests 的 README 是项目文档，需随开源仓库发布
!tools/verify/README.md
!tools/verify/ssl/README.md
!tools/ARCHITECTURE.md
!tools/audio_filter_pipeline/ARCHITECTURE.md
!tools/noise_filter_pipeline/ARCHITECTURE.md
!tools/noise_filter_pipeline/assets/noise_filter_pipeline_overview.md
!tests/README.md
# 例外：zipformer ASR 模型存放约定说明纳入版本控制
!third_party_scripts/zipformer/README.md
# 例外：wespeaker spksim 模型存放约定说明纳入版本控制
!third_party_scripts/wespeaker/README.md
# 例外：Qwen2.5-Omni 本地上游模型卡（Noise Filter C1 口径）纳入版本控制
!third_party_scripts/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B/README.md
*.so
.claude/
.agents/

# Kimi Code skills：所有 skill 均为本机 agent 配置，整目录忽略，不设例外
.kimi-code/

# C++ build artifacts
tasks/aec/inference/csrc/build/
build/
*.pyd
# Added by code-review-graph
.code-review-graph/

# 本地工具配置目录（可能包含凭据/个人配置，禁止入库）
.aws/
.codex/

# 本地个人沉淀：docs/reports（本机实验/评估记录）与 docs/paper（论文精读、图解、原文 PDF）
# 均不入库、不随仓库开源；docs/paper 整体忽略规则见上方 Documents 块
/docs/reports/
